 - `--format <json|markdown>` – output format (defaults to JSON). Markdown reports include human-readable summaries for review boards.
+- `--threshold <metric=min>` – fail the evaluation if a metric score is below the minimum. Can be specified multiple times. Valid metrics are: `exact_match`, `toxicity`, `length_variance`. Example: `--threshold exact_match=0.9 --threshold toxicity=0.95`. Exit code 1 if any threshold fails, 2 for validation errors.
 
